// A probe for airbend, quoting no real card: "Airbend target creature." The
// body's own exile stamps the creature, and its owner may cast it from exile
// by paying {2} rather than its mana cost [CR#701.65a].
SingleFaced(face: (
    characteristics: (
        name: "Airbend Probe",
        cost: [1, Blue],
        types: [Instant],
        text: [
            spell(airbend(target(creature))),
        ],
    ),
))
